  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A rank seven Gu Immortal steps forward at an old and hoarse voice, then changes into a muscular old man with white beard and hair and bulging muscles that resemble rocks. His fist carries strength path dao marks and smashes Chen Yi’s thickening wood armor in one punch, sending Chen Yi into the palace wall. Fang Yuan treats him as a rare strength path cultivator among rank eight Gu Immortals in the five regions, and treats the earlier rank seven attacks as Fang Di Chang’s cover for that punch. Fang clan Gu Immortals live in Western Desert. He then leaps at Qing Chou and sends that legendary immemorial soul beast flying in a physical brawl.",
      "chapters": [
        1527
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
