      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang clan’s first supreme elder speaks when Fang Yuan comes to headquarters to make a transaction. He is tall and sturdy, with long white hair and beard spreading around his head like a lion’s mane. The clan’s Gu Immortals fall silent and look to him. At that moment, only a rank eight Gu Immortal like Fang Gong can make the decision.",
      "chapters": [
        2101
